    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc9fNEW RELEASE!!\ud83d\udc9f</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>Merry XMerge </strong> is a good board game for <strong>all ages</strong> this Christmas. Put together Christmas cakes and candies to make them more attractive. The better your strategy, the higher your score will be. Join and play with your friends to see who is the winner and enjoy a fun moment together. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717080/extras/d6f52633fa2fef2c46a341144e4ce5e8.poster.avif?t=1709108842\" width=79 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717080/extras/d6f52633fa2fef2c46a341144e4ce5e8.webm?t=1709108842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> Merry Christmas.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::: - <u>GAME FEATURES</u> - ::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>2d Startegy Board Game</strong><br>You can rotate objects by clicking on them and dragging them onto the board.<br></li><li> <strong>Support Tools</strong><br>There are two boosters at the right corner to correct your mistakes - use diamonds to buy them.<br></li><li> <strong>Seven Levels Of Cake and Candy</strong><br>Match 3-5 pieces of your cakes and candies to increase into new forms and get 6 diamonds at the highest level. <br></li><li> <strong>Themes</strong><br>There are two themes added. You can optionally choose the Bear Cake Chef or Christmas Candy theme in the store.<br><i>Please write a review to let us know which themes you'd like to see added in the future.</i><br></li><li> <strong>Upcoming Feature</strong><br>You can pick the song you like from the list to increase your enjoyment when combining cakes and candies.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717080/extras/5ca23abe91fbcb5b2fad5e09ffdc098c.poster.avif?t=1709108842\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2717080/extras/5ca23abe91fbcb5b2fad5e09ffdc098c.webm?t=1709108842\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
